{"id":"conv_05534","context":"A uni student interviews a retired farmer","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":"respectful_curious","en":"You've been working in agriculture for a long time, haven't you?","jp":"長年、農業に携わってこられたんですよね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,4,8,17,26,51,68,84,170,184,1451,3682,6485,8331,8416,9283,14706,17069],"jpTokens":[{"s":"長年","r":"ながねん","w":3682},{"s":"、"},{"s":"農業","r":"のうぎょう","w":1451},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"携わっ","r":"たずさわっ","w":9283},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"こ","w":184},{"s":"られ","w":170},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":"grounded","en":"Yes. The quality of the soil and fertilizer—it directly shapes how well the crop turns out.","jp":"うん。肥料の質と農産物の出来、密接につながっている。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,9,18,348,1886,2747,2917,3154,3583,6771,7055,7885,8222,11215],"jpTokens":[{"s":"うん","w":2917},{"s":"。"},{"s":"肥料","r":"ひりょう","w":6771},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"質","r":"しつ","w":1886},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"農産物","r":"のうさんぶつ","w":8222},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"出来","r":"でき","w":348},{"s":"、"},{"s":"密接","r":"みっせつ","w":7055},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"つながっ","w":3154},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"いる","w":18},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":"thoughtful","en":"Those new regulations—were they difficult to implement out in the fields?","jp":"保安基準の発動、現場では大変でしたか。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,7,8,16,17,117,424,833,1039,4781,7202,7347,7507],"jpTokens":[{"s":"保安","r":"ほあん","w":7347},{"s":"基準","r":"きじゅん","w":833},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"発動","r":"はつどう","w":7507},{"s":"、"},{"s":"現場","r":"げんば","w":1039},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"大変","r":"たいへん","w":424},{"s":"でし","w":17},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":"warm_appreciative","en":"The young people with real drive—they picked up the new practices without comp